WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.070
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

3
01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel, Orchid Fragrance Fate)

4
01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 31= (This drama does not correspond)

5
01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

6
01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other dynastic elements have been adapted.)

7
01:41.480 --> 01:42.950
If it weren't for Lin Jinqi,

8
01:43.032 --> 01:44.990
how would Fourth Master ever have been convicted?

9
01:45.000 --> 01:45.840
Fourth Madam Dai.

10
01:46.056 --> 01:48.280
Dai Rong took his own life out of fear of punishment

11
01:48.290 --> 01:49.450
for colluding with Wo pirates.

12
01:49.460 --> 01:50.870
What does it have to do with others?

13
01:50.870 --> 01:51.430
You...

14
01:52.070 --> 01:52.950
That's enough.

15
01:52.968 --> 01:53.870
Let's leave here.

16
02:04.590 --> 02:06.680
No wonder you went from a sparrow to a phoenix

17
02:07.400 --> 02:08.590
and became Madam Lin.

18
02:08.648 --> 02:10.600
You certainly know how to get what you want.

19
02:26.560 --> 02:27.400
Madam Dai.

20
02:27.960 --> 02:29.750
You specifically invited me here.

21
02:30.190 --> 02:31.280
Surely it wasn't to discuss

22
02:31.280 --> 02:32.430
sparrows and phoenixes.

23
02:34.310 --> 02:35.750
What you really want to know

24
02:36.630 --> 02:38.710
is whether I know about the library.

25
02:47.120 --> 02:48.000
Everyone, leave.

26
03:02.630 --> 03:04.000
It's been so long.

27
03:04.680 --> 03:05.680
Does it really matter

28
03:06.310 --> 03:07.470
whether I know or not?

29
03:09.240 --> 03:11.360
I always like to get to the bottom of things

30
03:11.576 --> 03:13.000
and know exactly what happened.

31
03:13.800 --> 03:15.080
I can accept a setback,

32
03:15.590 --> 03:16.910
but I need to know

33
03:17.360 --> 03:18.870
exactly what caused it.

34
03:22.680 --> 03:23.840
Though I knew the truth,

35
03:24.240 --> 03:26.710
I never spoke of it or mentioned it to anyone,

36
03:27.120 --> 03:28.680
because I didn't want to die.

37
03:29.280 --> 03:31.120
I wanted to leave the Lin Residence alive

38
03:31.630 --> 03:33.000
and reunite with my parents.

39
03:46.800 --> 03:48.000
Lin Jinqi.

40
04:12.710 --> 04:13.870
If you want to save Ji'er,

41
04:14.870 --> 04:16.510
bring me 30,000 taels of silver.

42
04:17.560 --> 04:19.510
You're the Young Madam of the Lin Residence now.

43
04:19.870 --> 04:21.160
Surely you can come up

44
04:21.160 --> 04:22.310
with 30,000 taels of silver.

45
04:24.424 --> 04:26.510
When you were in charge of the Lin Residence,

46
04:26.568 --> 04:28.408
could you have come up with 10,000 taels?

47
04:30.520 --> 04:32.360
You're Grand Secretary Zhao's granddaughter,

48
04:32.360 --> 04:33.270
and even you couldn't.

49
04:34.560 --> 04:35.830
How could a mere maid like me

50
04:36.240 --> 04:37.800
possibly come up with that much?

51
04:39.720 --> 04:42.008
I didn't have an imperial decree granting me a marriage,

52
04:44.000 --> 04:46.160
nor am I Lin Jinqi's precious darling.

53
04:48.504 --> 04:50.840
It seems you're not trying to make things difficult for me.

54
04:50.850 --> 04:53.256
You're trying to make things difficult for Young Master Lin.

55
04:57.390 --> 04:59.920
But Young Master Lin doesn't even know who Ji'er is,

56
05:00.600 --> 05:01.480
nor does he care.

57
05:02.800 --> 05:04.750
That's what you get for marrying Lin Jinqi.

58
05:06.310 --> 05:08.600
Take your time finding a way if you can't raise the money.

59
05:08.920 --> 05:10.070
I'm in no hurry.

60
05:10.830 --> 05:11.950
But I am.

61
05:12.560 --> 05:13.720
That's none of my concern.

62
05:17.600 --> 05:19.630
Ji'er was bought by a shopkeeper of the Dai family.

63
05:19.784 --> 05:21.190
She's a servant of the Dai family.

64
05:21.750 --> 05:23.160
Even if you get the money,

65
05:23.560 --> 05:25.160
it will go to the Dai family.

66
05:26.760 --> 05:28.648
So it really has nothing to do with you.

67
05:33.310 --> 05:34.950
I don't understand what you mean.

68
05:35.510 --> 05:36.510
I'm Madam Dai.

69
05:36.776 --> 05:37.870
The Dai family's money

70
05:37.870 --> 05:39.360
has everything to do with me.

71
05:39.560 --> 05:40.800
You're Young Lady Zhao.

72
05:41.160 --> 05:43.920
Does that mean the Zhao family's earnings belong to you?

73
05:47.360 --> 05:49.190
What exactly are you trying to say?

74
05:51.560 --> 05:53.070
I want to offer you an idea

75
05:53.112 --> 05:54.480
in exchange for Ji'er and Xiaopu.

76
05:59.680 --> 06:01.120
What kind of idea

77
06:01.680 --> 06:03.190
could be worth 30,000 taels of silver?

78
06:04.000 --> 06:06.390
This idea will make the money you earn

79
06:06.390 --> 06:07.630
truly yours,

80
06:07.830 --> 06:10.630
belonging neither to the Dai family nor the Zhao family.

81
06:13.430 --> 06:15.310
I'm your father.

82
06:16.560 --> 06:18.870
Never mind your silver and your dowry.

83
06:19.070 --> 06:21.830
Even you belong to the Zhao family.

84
06:22.000 --> 06:24.000
Even if I beat you to death today,

85
06:24.190 --> 06:27.310
the world would only call you disobedient and unfilial.

86
06:28.070 --> 06:28.510
Go.

87
06:29.240 --> 06:31.600
Move her silver into the family coffers.

88
06:31.720 --> 06:33.080
Have it deposited in the treasury.

89
06:35.920 --> 06:37.510
They say learning teaches us reason.

90
06:38.510 --> 06:39.560
But there are some things

91
06:39.704 --> 06:41.750
I still can't make sense of even after studying.

92
06:42.856 --> 06:45.000
Sons and daughters are born to the same parents,

93
06:45.720 --> 06:48.870
yet sons are naturally entitled to inherit family property,

94
06:49.720 --> 06:51.510
while daughters can only gain

95
06:51.870 --> 06:54.000
a small share of it through marriage,

96
06:54.904 --> 06:56.240
in the form of a so-called dowry.

97
06:56.312 --> 06:58.350
If her father and brothers choose to give it to her,

98
06:58.360 --> 06:59.608
only then does it belong to her.

99
06:59.870 --> 07:02.560
If they choose not to, they can take it back at any time.

100
07:03.870 --> 07:06.360
For a woman in this world,

101
07:06.800 --> 07:09.750
she obeys her father at home and her husband after marriage.

102
07:10.510 --> 07:12.000
No matter how capable she may be,

103
07:12.950 --> 07:14.750
she must depend on a man

104
07:15.510 --> 07:17.000
to have a place in this world.

105
07:17.720 --> 07:19.360
Not a single coin she earns

106
07:20.070 --> 07:21.310
truly belongs to her.

107
07:23.912 --> 07:24.856
Perhaps it's because

108
07:24.888 --> 07:27.830
throughout history, most of those who wrote and shaped these ideas

109
07:28.160 --> 07:29.480
were men.

110
07:29.784 --> 07:31.920
They could never understand a woman's hardships

111
07:32.190 --> 07:33.310
or what women truly need.

112
07:37.950 --> 07:39.310
Then tell me.

113
07:40.680 --> 07:41.560
What can I do

114
07:41.680 --> 07:43.950
so that the money I've worked so hard to earn

115
07:43.976 --> 07:46.200
belongs neither to the Zhao family through my father

116
07:46.280 --> 07:48.310
nor to the Dai family through my husband,

117
07:48.480 --> 07:49.680
but to me alone?

118
07:50.560 --> 07:51.920
If what you say makes sense,

119
07:53.000 --> 07:55.920
I'll give you both indentures.

120
07:59.750 --> 08:01.870
I read a story in a book.

121
08:02.264 --> 08:03.750
During Emperor Shengzu's reign,

122
08:03.880 --> 08:06.870
the Xu brothers of Chun'an divided the family property and lived separately.

123
08:07.390 --> 08:09.680
The youngest brother's widow received only an old servant.

124
08:11.000 --> 08:13.352
The widow sold all her hairpins, earrings, and other jewelry

125
08:13.384 --> 08:14.390
for twelve taels of gold.

126
08:14.744 --> 08:17.544
The old servant took the gold into the mountains to trade in lacquer.

127
08:17.710 --> 08:20.728
Twenty years later, he had amassed a fortune worth tens of thousands in gold

128
08:20.870 --> 08:22.480
and handed it all over to his madam,

129
08:23.070 --> 08:24.070
making the widow

130
08:24.630 --> 08:26.390
the wealthiest person in the county.

131
08:31.560 --> 08:33.600
Showing off just because you can read?

132
08:33.784 --> 08:36.480
The widow was treated unfairly when the family property was divided.

133
08:36.536 --> 08:38.184
Afraid she couldn't manage on her own,

134
08:38.504 --> 08:40.568
she didn't dare let her husband's brothers find out.

135
08:40.632 --> 08:43.270
She secretly gave the twelve taels of gold from selling her jewelry

136
08:43.480 --> 08:44.600
to the old servant.

137
08:45.000 --> 08:46.120
Twenty years later,

138
08:46.264 --> 08:49.620
the old servant returned all the tens of thousands in gold he had earned

139
08:49.630 --> 08:51.750
to the widow.

140
08:52.670 --> 08:54.670
It's an anecdote praising the old servant

141
08:54.750 --> 08:56.200
for his loyalty and integrity.

142
08:57.150 --> 08:58.790
But from the widow's perspective,

143
08:59.750 --> 09:02.510
our laws allow servants to engage in trade,

144
09:02.720 --> 09:04.200
but they cannot own private property.

145
09:04.960 --> 09:07.720
Whatever a servant earns belongs to the master.

146
09:09.240 --> 09:12.120
By using the old servant to conceal the truth,

147
09:12.200 --> 09:14.616
the widow managed to amass a fortune worth tens of thousands.

148
09:18.720 --> 09:21.510
Qingxiang's indenture isn't held by the Dai family

149
09:21.670 --> 09:23.000
or the Zhao family, is it?

150
09:24.024 --> 09:26.910
After being played once by that wretched old woman of the Lin family,

151
09:27.000 --> 09:28.536
you think I haven't learned my lesson?

152
09:28.870 --> 09:30.120
I keep it myself.

153
09:31.790 --> 09:32.790
This method

154
09:33.080 --> 09:34.000
may not let you

155
09:34.000 --> 09:35.790
earn 30,000 taels of silver overnight,

156
09:36.840 --> 09:38.200
but from now on,

157
09:38.200 --> 09:39.440
every coin you earn

158
09:39.960 --> 09:41.320
will belong to you alone.

159
09:49.320 --> 09:50.790
Ji'er and Xiaopu's indentures.

160
10:03.600 --> 10:05.200
I misjudged you before.

161
10:06.320 --> 10:08.510
It's that ungrateful Lin Jinqi

162
10:08.720 --> 10:09.670
who doesn't deserve you.

163
10:10.960 --> 10:11.870
How about

164
10:13.320 --> 10:14.320
you and I

165
10:15.360 --> 10:16.600
go into business together?

166
10:17.600 --> 10:19.080
With the Zhao,

167
10:19.360 --> 10:21.360
Dai, and Lin families behind us,

168
10:22.200 --> 10:23.320
forget 30,000 taels.

169
10:24.080 --> 10:26.080
Even 50,000 or 100,000 taels,

170
10:26.870 --> 10:28.200
we could earn it.

171
10:29.320 --> 10:31.320
Thank you for thinking so highly of me.

172
10:31.336 --> 10:33.128
But that's not where my ambitions lie.

173
10:35.480 --> 10:36.480
What a shame.

174
10:43.790 --> 10:46.550
(Indenture) I promised to return the indentures,

175
10:47.510 --> 10:48.790
but I never promised

176
10:48.870 --> 10:50.510
to let Ji'er leave today.

177
10:52.150 --> 10:54.670
Unless you can knock the ball into the hole.

178
10:55.510 --> 10:56.360
Otherwise,

179
10:57.000 --> 10:58.910
you'll have to come back another day for Ji'er.

180
12:08.020 --> 12:10.100
♪Those things I can't forget♪

181
12:10.100 --> 12:14.420
♪The absurdities I can't let go of fill every page♪

182
12:14.420 --> 12:16.460
♪Building a wall♪

183
12:19.320 --> 12:20.720
Lanxiang!

184
12:24.820 --> 12:27.100
♪Memories hide away again♪

185
12:27.100 --> 12:31.580
♪Silent, yet they never stop shining♪

186
12:31.580 --> 12:33.580
♪Still burning bright♪

187
12:33.580 --> 12:36.460
♪That's what made me who I am♪

188
12:38.320 --> 12:39.240
You're free.

189
12:41.220 --> 12:45.180
♪Etched into my heart♪

190
12:46.480 --> 12:47.550
From now on,

191
12:48.750 --> 12:49.600
you're free.

192
12:57.870 --> 12:59.750
I'm free.

193
13:15.560 --> 13:17.030
The room has just been cleaned.

194
13:17.270 --> 13:19.000
The bedding is clean, too.

195
13:19.390 --> 13:21.200
You three can stay here without worry.

196
13:21.480 --> 13:23.720
I'll go get you some hot water from the boiler room.

197
13:23.720 --> 13:24.440
All right.

198
13:25.600 --> 13:26.240
Thank you.

199
13:27.870 --> 13:28.720
I'll help him.

200
13:28.720 --> 13:29.360
All right.

201
13:45.270 --> 13:46.790
This is Ji'er's indenture.

202
13:49.480 --> 13:50.960
And this is Xiaopu's indenture.

203
13:51.260 --> 13:53.780
(Indenture)

204
13:55.440 --> 13:56.600
Good.

205
14:00.390 --> 14:02.480
This is the Deed of Emancipation I've signed.

206
14:03.320 --> 14:04.260
(Deed of Emancipation)

207
14:04.856 --> 14:06.870
Later, Yuchan will go with you to the county office

208
14:06.870 --> 14:08.450
to complete the emancipation procedures.

209
14:08.600 --> 14:09.870
I can act as your guarantor,

210
14:10.056 --> 14:11.670
so you can register here in the capital

211
14:11.790 --> 14:12.870
with a nearby neighborhood,

212
14:14.840 --> 14:16.320
or return to Jinling to register.

213
14:24.750 --> 14:26.550
I don't want to register in the capital,

214
14:26.632 --> 14:29.224
and I don't want to return to Jinling to register either.

215
14:35.360 --> 14:36.720
You want to find your parents?

216
14:37.510 --> 14:39.720
Do you know where your parents are?

217
14:41.670 --> 14:42.720
I'm not going to find them.

218
14:44.320 --> 14:45.840
The only family I have is Xiaopu

219
14:47.390 --> 14:48.000
and you.

220
14:54.168 --> 14:56.150
Ji'er secretly left all the tips from the guests

221
14:56.200 --> 14:59.910
with her parents, hoping to save enough to buy her freedom.

222
15:01.360 --> 15:02.360
But one day,

223
15:02.960 --> 15:05.550
when she went to see them, she discovered

224
15:06.720 --> 15:07.790
that over a month earlier,

225
15:08.120 --> 15:10.790
they had taken Ji'er's money

226
15:10.856 --> 15:12.120
to buy freedom for themselves

227
15:12.440 --> 15:13.790
and their two sons,

228
15:15.240 --> 15:16.390
and then secretly fled.

229
15:31.790 --> 15:33.150
There's nothing to be sad about.

230
15:33.790 --> 15:34.600
That money

231
15:34.790 --> 15:36.910
can count as repayment for your parents raising you.

232
15:37.080 --> 15:39.032
From now on, you owe each other nothing.

233
15:39.160 --> 15:40.720
You can each live your own lives.

234
15:43.200 --> 15:44.390
That's exactly how I see it.

235
15:48.960 --> 15:50.600
Xiaopu and I already agreed

236
15:50.960 --> 15:52.440
that if we ever gained our freedom,

237
15:52.910 --> 15:54.600
we'd go to Quanzhou.

238
15:55.790 --> 15:56.720
Quanzhou?

239
15:59.480 --> 16:01.000
The merchants who trade by sea

240
16:01.000 --> 16:02.150
often talk about Quanzhou.

241
16:02.600 --> 16:04.360
They say it's unlike anywhere else.

242
16:05.120 --> 16:06.720
There are enormous seagoing ships,

243
16:07.960 --> 16:09.960
all kinds of exotic goods from overseas,

244
16:11.120 --> 16:12.670
men of different skin colors,

245
16:13.320 --> 16:14.270
and even blonde women

246
16:14.550 --> 16:16.320
with their legs and chests exposed.

247
16:18.080 --> 16:18.960
Quanzhou

248
16:19.480 --> 16:21.440
is different from the capital, Yangzhou,

249
16:21.510 --> 16:23.390
and Jinling.

250
16:23.600 --> 16:26.390
Women there can establish their own households and support themselves.

251
16:27.112 --> 16:28.424
What do they call it again?

252
16:29.192 --> 16:30.120
Female households.

253
16:30.960 --> 16:32.150
Right, female households.

254
16:32.824 --> 16:35.200
In Quanzhou, once a woman establishes a female household,

255
16:35.256 --> 16:36.670
she doesn't have to depend on a man.

256
16:37.200 --> 16:38.390
She can go out on her own,

257
16:38.790 --> 16:40.600
run a shop, and do business.

258
16:43.688 --> 16:46.104
Although they'll be looked down upon by scholars

259
16:46.270 --> 16:47.910
and ladies of respectable families,

260
16:48.840 --> 16:50.510
merchants don't mind dealing with them

261
16:51.150 --> 16:52.600
as long as there's money to be made.

262
16:55.670 --> 16:56.790
You want to go somewhere

263
16:56.790 --> 16:58.240
completely different

264
16:58.670 --> 16:59.840
and start over?

265
17:09.580 --> 17:11.620
(Indenture)

266
17:12.520 --> 17:14.152
Not as a maid of the Lin Residence,

267
17:15.480 --> 17:16.750
not as Young Lady Shuang,

268
17:18.200 --> 17:19.880
not as Concubine Lv.

269
17:27.110 --> 17:29.110
I want to truly live

270
17:30.270 --> 17:31.200
as Lv Ji'er for once.

271
17:44.590 --> 17:46.790
Can I go to Quanzhou with you?

272
17:50.360 --> 17:52.750
Xiaopu and I would certainly welcome another helping hand.

273
17:54.550 --> 17:56.400
But even in Quanzhou,

274
17:56.472 --> 17:58.990
women who establish their own households and support themselves

275
17:59.070 --> 18:01.750
are called shameless and treated with contempt.

276
18:06.936 --> 18:09.208
I've long since stopped caring what people think of me.

277
18:15.750 --> 18:16.240
All right.

278
18:17.440 --> 18:18.400
The three of us

279
18:18.480 --> 18:19.784
will go to Quanzhou together.

280
18:29.030 --> 18:29.920
But

281
18:31.640 --> 18:33.160
we'll still need Lanxiang's help

282
18:34.200 --> 18:35.240
to get the three of us

283
18:36.680 --> 18:37.720
registered in Quanzhou.

284
18:40.160 --> 18:41.480
Have you all made up your minds?

285
18:56.160 --> 18:56.640
Yes.

286
18:57.790 --> 19:00.070
I'll find a way to help you register there.

287
19:05.160 --> 19:06.510
That's wonderful, Lanxiang.

288
19:07.110 --> 19:09.110
What am I going to do? You're too good to me.

289
19:10.590 --> 19:12.200
I almost don't want to leave.

290
19:13.310 --> 19:14.920
Then stay here with me.

291
19:18.160 --> 19:20.240
But I won't put myself through that again.

292
19:25.400 --> 19:26.510
From this day forward,

293
19:28.270 --> 19:30.240
the person who will treat me best in this world

294
19:31.750 --> 19:32.680
is myself.

295
19:35.440 --> 19:36.160
Good.

296
19:59.464 --> 20:00.680
You're saying the Young Madam

297
20:00.680 --> 20:02.350
didn't give Madam Dai a single coin

298
20:02.830 --> 20:04.030
and still brought them back?

299
20:06.070 --> 20:08.640
Young Master really underestimated the Young Madam this time.

300
20:09.750 --> 20:11.070
I saw it with my own eyes.

301
20:11.200 --> 20:13.160
The Young Madam spoke with Madam Dai for a while,

302
20:13.270 --> 20:15.240
and Madam Dai handed her the indentures.

303
20:16.072 --> 20:17.510
I asked the Young Madam afterward,

304
20:17.680 --> 20:20.590
and she said that as a fellow woman,

305
20:20.790 --> 20:22.720
she understood Madam Dai's pain.

306
20:22.880 --> 20:25.240
She reasoned with her and showed her the benefits,

307
20:25.416 --> 20:28.216
joking that she'd gotten what she wanted without spending a thing.

308
20:30.750 --> 20:32.480
Reason with her

309
20:33.510 --> 20:34.790
and show her the benefits.

310
20:41.830 --> 20:43.440
Young Master, you can rest now.

311
20:47.680 --> 20:49.880
Didn't you say the Young Madam wanted to get those three

312
20:49.920 --> 20:51.160
registered in Quanzhou?

313
20:51.440 --> 20:52.070
Yes.

314
20:52.232 --> 20:54.000
The Young Madam even went to the bookshop

315
20:54.000 --> 20:56.510
and borrowed several books on laws and household registration.

316
21:00.200 --> 21:01.240
Did you tell her

317
21:01.590 --> 21:02.750
what I asked you to?

318
21:03.070 --> 21:03.720
Yes.

319
21:04.070 --> 21:05.240
I told the Young Madam

320
21:05.270 --> 21:06.640
that a superior you were

321
21:06.640 --> 21:08.070
close to back in Jinzhou

322
21:08.110 --> 21:10.280
is now Assistant Commander of the Quanzhou Garrison.

323
21:15.270 --> 21:16.350
Then tell me.

324
21:17.510 --> 21:19.400
Do you think she didn't understand what I meant?

325
21:20.750 --> 21:22.070
Even I understood.

326
21:22.168 --> 21:22.936
Given your

327
21:22.940 --> 21:25.580
relationship with the Assistant Commander of the Quanzhou Garrison,

328
21:25.590 --> 21:27.680
getting Ji'er and the others registered in Quanzhou

329
21:27.680 --> 21:29.000
would only take a word from you.

330
21:29.032 --> 21:30.790
How could the Young Madam not understand?

331
21:38.790 --> 21:40.510
Since it's on your mind,

332
21:40.880 --> 21:42.960
why not offer to help her?

333
21:43.352 --> 21:45.560
You'd solve the Young Madam's urgent problem,

334
21:45.790 --> 21:47.400
and you'd be able to sleep soundly, too.

335
21:51.680 --> 21:52.310
Nonsense.

336
21:52.472 --> 21:54.880
Even when the Wo pirates attacked, I slept perfectly soundly.

337
21:54.960 --> 21:56.070
Now that I'm in my own home,

338
21:56.216 --> 21:57.590
why wouldn't I sleep soundly?

339
21:58.424 --> 21:59.680
I'm going to sleep right now.

340
21:59.920 --> 22:01.110
I won't wake up until morning.

341
22:28.648 --> 22:31.240
It's not easy for an adult man to establish his own household.

342
22:31.920 --> 22:33.790
He needs the consent of his senior clansmen

343
22:33.800 --> 22:35.816
and a neighborhood headman to act as guarantor.

344
22:36.480 --> 22:39.110
It's even harder for an adult woman to establish her own household.

345
22:40.400 --> 22:41.960
She's lucky if she's allowed to at all.

346
22:42.760 --> 22:44.320
It even says here that female households

347
22:44.510 --> 22:47.336
should be abolished if they hinder the collection of corvée duties.

348
22:48.110 --> 22:57.240
A female household must be verified to have no adult male members.

349
22:58.630 --> 23:01.272
To establish a female household, besides having no husband or sons

350
23:01.320 --> 23:03.624
and truly having no adult male in the household,

351
23:04.088 --> 23:06.110
she must own taxable farmland in the countryside

352
23:07.000 --> 23:08.440
or property in an urban neighborhood

353
23:09.110 --> 23:10.510
before she can register locally.

354
23:13.064 --> 23:14.350
That shouldn't be a problem.

355
23:15.160 --> 23:15.960
Ji'er and the others

356
23:15.960 --> 23:18.264
are going there to make a living through business anyway.

357
23:18.296 --> 23:20.940
Sooner or later, they'll acquire property in an urban neighborhood.

358
23:21.000 --> 23:23.590
They just need to set aside the money in advance.

359
23:24.640 --> 23:25.790
Then what's the difficulty?

360
23:28.070 --> 23:29.550
Anyone registering as a local resident

361
23:30.000 --> 23:31.464
needs a respected local resident

362
23:31.496 --> 23:33.350
to recommend them and act as a guarantor

363
23:33.510 --> 23:35.590
before they can settle there.

364
23:36.240 --> 23:38.350
Then just ask them to be guarantors.

365
23:38.750 --> 23:40.880
Give them some gifts and ask for their help.

366
23:41.790 --> 23:43.200
It's not a matter of giving gifts.

367
23:43.512 --> 23:45.550
Since they're respected members of the community,

368
23:45.560 --> 23:47.820
they may disapprove of Ji'er and the others' backgrounds

369
23:47.830 --> 23:49.480
and refuse their gifts outright.

370
23:50.720 --> 23:52.310
If the neighbors found out otherwise,

371
23:52.960 --> 23:54.720
their lifelong reputations would be ruined.

372
24:13.110 --> 24:14.000
Young Master.

373
24:23.112 --> 24:24.680
Young Master, please sit.

374
24:31.590 --> 24:33.070
If you keep studying like this,

375
24:34.456 --> 24:36.590
you could take a post at the Ministry of Revenue.

376
24:40.200 --> 24:42.200
No amount of reading will help Ji'er.

377
24:43.510 --> 24:44.920
I'll just have to swallow my pride

378
24:45.440 --> 24:46.720
and ask you for help.

379
24:51.590 --> 24:52.790
We're husband and wife.

380
24:53.448 --> 24:54.960
There's no need to speak like that.

381
24:55.960 --> 24:57.310
We should help each other.

382
25:07.240 --> 25:08.590
After Yuchan told me,

383
25:08.790 --> 25:10.310
I'd already written a letter

384
25:10.344 --> 25:12.472
and sent someone to deliver it to Quanzhou.

385
25:14.310 --> 25:17.790
The wife of the Assistant Commander of the Quanzhou Garrison is surnamed Xu.

386
25:18.280 --> 25:19.920
Her surname sounds the same as yours,

387
25:20.232 --> 25:22.390
but it's the Xu written with the double-person radical.

388
25:23.590 --> 25:26.720
Write a letter of introduction to Madam Xu

389
25:27.200 --> 25:30.310
and have Young Lady Lv and the other two take it to Quanzhou.

390
25:30.960 --> 25:34.160
Madam Xu will help make the necessary arrangements with the local neighborhood

391
25:34.440 --> 25:36.350
and get their household registration settled.

392
25:41.590 --> 25:42.350
Thank you.

393
25:49.270 --> 25:50.790
I'm not capable enough yet

394
25:52.590 --> 25:54.720
to even help my own sisters,

395
25:57.160 --> 25:59.000
and I have no way to repay you.

396
26:03.510 --> 26:05.590
If you ever need my help in the future,

397
26:06.640 --> 26:08.200
I'll do everything I can.

398
26:12.920 --> 26:13.880
I only want

399
26:15.510 --> 26:16.960
you to be my wife.

400
26:24.310 --> 26:25.880
Aren't I already?

401
26:31.590 --> 26:32.720
What I want

402
26:34.880 --> 26:37.110
isn't just to have you here with me,

403
26:39.680 --> 26:40.790
but your heart as well.

404
26:45.960 --> 26:47.240
I'm already here.

405
26:48.880 --> 26:50.590
Where could my heart possibly go?

406
26:51.140 --> 26:56.020
♪Through life's winding road, we've weathered countless trials♪

407
26:58.140 --> 27:02.020
♪I'm blessed to spend each peaceful day and night with you♪

408
27:02.030 --> 27:03.310
You're so clever.

409
27:04.792 --> 27:06.888
There's no way you don't understand what I mean.

410
27:09.590 --> 27:12.070
You're simply pretending not to understand.

411
27:12.660 --> 27:15.380
♪Our bond runs deep♪

412
27:16.060 --> 27:19.060
♪Binding us closely together♪

413
27:19.860 --> 27:22.620
♪Washing away the dust of this mortal world♪

414
27:22.620 --> 27:26.820
♪Even if we must part in the end♪

415
27:27.500 --> 27:31.420
♪I'll have no regrets that we met in this life♪

416
27:31.420 --> 27:35.420
♪May we stay together until life's end♪

417
27:35.420 --> 27:39.060
♪Every sincerity you've shown me♪

418
27:39.060 --> 27:42.860
♪Has long taken root in my heart♪

419
27:42.860 --> 27:45.740
♪Our bond runs deep♪

420
27:46.500 --> 27:49.580
♪Binding us closely together♪

421
27:50.220 --> 27:53.140
♪After all the questions life has brought♪

422
27:53.140 --> 27:57.380
♪This love has never faded in the slightest♪

423
27:58.060 --> 28:01.900
♪A trace of fragrance lingers on♪

424
28:02.260 --> 28:05.660
♪How fortunate to find one person in a lifetime♪

425
28:06.300 --> 28:08.020
♪Through these warm and gentle years♪

426
28:08.340 --> 28:13.380
♪My heart remains as true to you as ever♪

427
28:13.380 --> 28:19.240
(Chengding Gate)

428
28:19.304 --> 28:21.690
It's already the twenty-fifth day of the twelfth lunar month.

429
28:21.790 --> 28:23.710
Can't you wait until after the Chinese New Year

430
28:23.720 --> 28:25.240
and leave when the weather gets warmer?

431
28:25.480 --> 28:27.440
The Chinese New Year is for families to reunite.

432
28:28.590 --> 28:30.510
My family is right here with me.

433
28:32.120 --> 28:35.080
Wherever we go, that's where we'll celebrate the Chinese New Year.

434
28:36.480 --> 28:37.590
Even if we stayed here,

435
28:37.640 --> 28:39.640
we couldn't spend Chinese New Year's Eve with you.

436
28:39.830 --> 28:41.880
So we thought we'd head to Quanzhou early.

437
28:42.720 --> 28:43.790
We want to set off early.

438
28:45.030 --> 28:46.680
I know you can't wait.

439
28:50.070 --> 28:52.790
Once you reach Quanzhou, be sure to write to me.

440
28:54.040 --> 28:56.550
Xiaopu knows a little writing, so she'll write to you first.

441
28:57.480 --> 28:58.920
Once I learn how to write,

442
28:59.030 --> 29:00.136
I'll write to you myself.

443
29:00.232 --> 29:01.960
Don't laugh if my handwriting is ugly.

444
29:03.350 --> 29:06.000
I'll learn to write too and send you letters.

445
29:06.680 --> 29:07.270
All right.

446
29:10.760 --> 29:11.496
Baogai.

447
29:17.510 --> 29:18.960
Here are some old clothes.

448
29:19.200 --> 29:20.200
Keep them to wear.

449
29:21.750 --> 29:23.510
And as a memento.

450
29:46.550 --> 29:47.750
Three padded coats.

451
29:48.536 --> 29:50.030
We've sewn gold leaves into them.

452
29:51.240 --> 29:53.350
They're worth 500 taels of silver.

453
30:01.352 --> 30:04.160
Once you're in the mule cart, put them on and keep them close.

454
30:20.480 --> 30:22.960
Xiaolian, Baogai, and I

455
30:23.110 --> 30:25.080
scraped together 30 taels of silver for you.

456
30:26.680 --> 30:27.550
No.

457
30:28.590 --> 30:30.030
Yuchan added another 20 taels.

458
30:30.160 --> 30:31.400
That's 50 taels in total.

459
30:31.590 --> 30:33.920
No. I can't take it.

460
30:34.030 --> 30:37.110
You've already given me money for the journey.

461
30:37.790 --> 30:39.070
Quanzhou is so far away.

462
30:39.224 --> 30:41.480
I hear we won't even understand how the locals speak.

463
30:41.576 --> 30:43.200
There's not much we can do to help you.

464
30:43.270 --> 30:45.208
All we can do is put together some money for you.

465
30:46.400 --> 30:47.510
You must keep it safe.

466
30:53.848 --> 30:55.750
They say you should travel with plenty of money.

467
30:56.960 --> 30:58.440
Just consider it a loan from us.

468
30:58.590 --> 31:01.240
You can pay us back once you've made some money.

469
31:08.552 --> 31:09.960
I'd already made up my mind.

470
31:09.960 --> 31:11.550
I absolutely wasn't going to cry today.

471
31:13.192 --> 31:14.310
We're going to Quanzhou.

472
31:14.310 --> 31:15.880
This is wonderful news.

473
31:16.440 --> 31:17.960
I want to leave happily.

474
31:17.960 --> 31:19.160
I want to leave with a smile.

475
31:20.400 --> 31:22.270
It's all your fault.

476
31:22.480 --> 31:24.160
You just had to make me cry again.

477
31:25.160 --> 31:28.270
Tears don't cost anything. Just cry if you want.

478
31:28.312 --> 31:30.030
It's because I know tears are worthless

479
31:30.030 --> 31:31.160
that I don't want to cry.

480
31:38.110 --> 31:39.510
It's all your fault.

481
31:53.112 --> 31:55.080
Young Madam. The caravan is already far ahead.

482
31:55.090 --> 31:56.760
They need to catch up as soon as possible.

483
31:56.880 --> 31:58.200
If they miss this caravan,

484
31:58.270 --> 31:59.550
the next one going to Quanzhou

485
31:59.550 --> 32:00.880
won't leave until next spring.

486
32:04.920 --> 32:05.550
We're going now.

487
32:06.110 --> 32:08.310
We're going. Let's go.

488
32:22.216 --> 32:23.750
Take good care of yourselves.

489
32:31.310 --> 32:33.400
We're leaving. Goodbye.

490
32:34.740 --> 32:37.300
♪All things fall silent, fearing♪

491
32:37.300 --> 32:40.660
♪To disturb this moment♪

492
32:41.420 --> 32:44.220
♪My restless heart♪

493
32:44.580 --> 32:48.420
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

494
32:49.060 --> 32:54.740
♪I wonder if the past has ever been heard♪

495
32:57.500 --> 33:00.740
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

496
33:00.740 --> 33:04.260
♪Lightly sketch out cause and effect♪

497
33:04.980 --> 33:07.540
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

498
33:07.540 --> 33:11.220
♪Returns to this moment♪

499
33:11.220 --> 33:15.060
♪Love and guilt intertwine♪

500
33:15.060 --> 33:18.540
♪If the shadow isn't real, what then?♪

501
33:20.590 --> 33:23.640
Be careful on the way. Take good care of yourself!

502
33:24.920 --> 33:26.590
I'll live well!

503
33:27.310 --> 33:30.640
You'd better live well, too!

504
33:34.220 --> 33:37.780
♪I only hope those I once knew remain♪

505
33:37.780 --> 33:41.380
♪Safe and well as they grow♪

506
33:41.380 --> 33:46.140
♪Never again letting the world's wind and snow fall♪

507
33:46.140 --> 33:48.900
♪And cover the grass and trees in frost♪

508
33:48.900 --> 33:53.140
♪I only wish that where the lights grow dim♪

509
33:53.340 --> 33:58.060
♪You and I will go together♪

510
34:00.350 --> 34:01.480
(From this day forward,)

511
34:01.960 --> 34:03.480
(not as a maid of the Lin Residence,)

512
34:03.880 --> 34:05.160
(not as Young Lady Shuang,)

513
34:06.160 --> 34:07.830
(not as Concubine Lv.)

514
34:08.760 --> 34:10.630
(I want to truly live as Lv Ji'er)

515
34:12.000 --> 34:12.800
(for once.)

516
34:17.190 --> 34:19.190
(My surname is Lv. My name is Ji'er.)

517
34:19.360 --> 34:21.190
I can cook and do laundry.

518
34:21.590 --> 34:23.710
I raised all my younger brothers myself.

519
34:23.710 --> 34:26.320
From now on, everyone in this room will listen to Ji'er.

520
34:27.070 --> 34:28.510
So what if I'm a third-rank maid?

521
34:29.280 --> 34:31.070
I didn't steal it!

522
34:31.280 --> 34:32.510
Now that there's someone new,

523
34:33.070 --> 34:34.510
no one listens to me anymore.

524
34:34.760 --> 34:36.360
If you're so capable, go hit a man!

525
34:37.110 --> 34:38.110
From this day forward,

526
34:38.590 --> 34:40.630
the person who will treat me best in this world

527
34:41.000 --> 34:41.760
is myself.

528
34:48.632 --> 34:51.192
Ji'er and the others are traveling with a large merchant caravan.

529
34:52.110 --> 34:53.480
The journey may be difficult,

530
34:53.560 --> 34:55.480
but there's no need to worry about their safety.

531
34:56.630 --> 34:58.360
They'll definitely reach Quanzhou safely.

532
35:09.700 --> 35:13.980
(500 taels were raised by pawning.)

533
35:30.670 --> 35:33.550
Ji'er and the other two didn't have a penny.

534
35:34.110 --> 35:35.480
The Young Madam gave them

535
35:35.480 --> 35:37.670
300 taels from her dowry for the journey.

536
35:38.510 --> 35:39.360
In private,

537
35:40.000 --> 35:42.360
the Young Madam also had Baogai quietly go to a pawnshop

538
35:44.030 --> 35:46.190
and pawn her jewelry for 500 taels of silver.

539
35:46.328 --> 35:49.304
She exchanged it for gold leaves and sewed them into old padded coats.

540
35:49.352 --> 35:51.220
She was even afraid Ji'er wouldn't accept them,

541
35:51.230 --> 35:53.550
so she waited until they were parting to give them to her.

542
35:53.720 --> 35:56.190
People say I'm one of His Majesty's most trusted officials,

543
35:57.110 --> 35:58.670
at the height of my glory.

544
36:00.760 --> 36:01.920
Yet my own wife

545
36:03.400 --> 36:04.550
had to pawn her jewelry

546
36:05.510 --> 36:06.920
for 500 taels.

547
36:09.912 --> 36:11.848
The Young Madam only pawned them temporarily.

548
36:11.928 --> 36:14.840
She arranged with the pawnshop to redeem them within three months.

549
36:16.070 --> 36:18.070
She only needed some money to tide her over.

550
36:18.296 --> 36:20.710
That's common among wealthy families in the capital, too.

551
36:23.880 --> 36:25.110
I'm not angry with her.

552
36:25.960 --> 36:27.150
Why are you all so anxious?

553
36:27.670 --> 36:29.110
The Young Madam is a good person.

554
36:31.190 --> 36:31.760
Yes.

555
36:32.550 --> 36:34.920
The Young Madam is kindhearted.

556
36:39.480 --> 36:42.190
Young Master, you're a good person, too.

557
36:49.510 --> 36:50.320
Enough.

558
36:52.000 --> 36:53.800
How would I dare be angry with her?

559
36:55.230 --> 36:56.440
I just want to see

560
36:57.000 --> 36:57.920
how she's going to

561
36:59.030 --> 37:00.590
redeem the jewelry when the time comes.

562
37:01.150 --> 37:02.000
Now,

563
37:02.590 --> 37:05.070
the Young Madam has no private savings left.

564
37:06.590 --> 37:07.880
Young Master, you'll have to

565
37:08.400 --> 37:09.320
think of something.

566
37:09.550 --> 37:10.480
Otherwise,

567
37:11.280 --> 37:12.440
forget redeeming the jewelry.

568
37:12.480 --> 37:14.840
Even everyday expenses and social obligations

569
37:15.150 --> 37:16.400
require money.

570
37:17.630 --> 37:18.960
The Young Madam will find a way.

571
37:27.000 --> 37:28.630
Even I'm not that confident.

572
37:29.840 --> 37:31.480
What makes you so confident?

573
37:32.984 --> 37:35.000
Back then, didn't you also think that as a woman,

574
37:35.032 --> 37:37.320
the Young Madam was alone and powerless

575
37:37.320 --> 37:39.210
and couldn't get Ji'er back without your help?

576
37:39.510 --> 37:42.280
But she proved that she not only did it without your help,

577
37:42.360 --> 37:44.800
but she also got Ji'er back without spending a single coin.

578
37:48.150 --> 37:50.320
Yuchan is simple by nature.

579
37:53.976 --> 37:56.136
Ever since she started serving the Young Madam,

580
37:56.190 --> 37:57.400
she's been completely

581
37:58.150 --> 37:59.150
devoted to her.

582
38:03.230 --> 38:04.320
All right.

583
38:05.704 --> 38:06.920
Whether that's true or not,

584
38:07.590 --> 38:08.440
we'll know

585
38:09.000 --> 38:10.070
in three months.

586
38:11.220 --> 38:12.900
(500 taels were raised by pawning.)

587
38:14.380 --> 38:17.420
(Three Months Later)

588
38:43.980 --> 38:47.380
(Ting Lizi, Troupe Leader of Xiaofurong Troupe)

589
38:50.320 --> 38:52.110
Troupe Leader, Madam Lin is here.

590
38:54.920 --> 38:57.550
Didn't you say coming here could cure your homesickness?

591
38:57.840 --> 38:59.110
You haven't come in so long.

592
38:59.590 --> 39:01.480
It seems you don't miss my master

593
39:01.480 --> 39:02.440
or Mister Lu at all.

594
39:04.440 --> 39:05.960
I didn't dare come too often.

595
39:06.400 --> 39:08.840
I was afraid you'd think I was here to ask for money.

596
39:09.400 --> 39:10.590
So this time,

597
39:11.000 --> 39:12.190
you're not here for money?

598
39:15.400 --> 39:17.630
This time, I'm mainly here to cure my homesickness

599
39:17.784 --> 39:19.190
and ask for money while I'm at it.

600
39:21.000 --> 39:22.190
Here's 50 taels.

601
39:22.590 --> 39:24.190
Together with the previous 100 taels,

602
39:25.110 --> 39:25.960
over three months,

603
39:26.360 --> 39:27.710
that's a total of 150 taels.

604
39:29.336 --> 39:30.696
Before the Chinese New Year,

605
39:30.712 --> 39:33.336
my master brought together opera troupes from Jinling,

606
39:33.590 --> 39:34.670
the capital, and Suzhou

607
39:34.670 --> 39:36.150
to stage the new play together.

608
39:36.550 --> 39:39.190
The Tale of the Feathered Immortal became an instant hit.

609
39:39.800 --> 39:40.710
These days,

610
39:40.760 --> 39:42.960
if any lady hasn't seen it yet,

611
39:42.960 --> 39:45.550
she has to hurry and invite a troupe to perform at her residence.

612
39:46.030 --> 39:48.480
Otherwise, when she's with other ladies,

613
39:48.510 --> 39:50.536
she won't even have anything to talk about.

614
39:51.920 --> 39:53.000
In just these three months,

615
39:53.550 --> 39:55.670
we've earned as much as we used to in an entire year.

616
39:56.872 --> 39:58.670
It's because you performed it so well

617
39:58.710 --> 40:00.230
that the play became such a hit.

618
40:00.840 --> 40:03.630
No matter how well we perform, we still need a good script.

619
40:03.832 --> 40:05.400
(Xu Lanxiang) These days, who can hear

620
40:05.410 --> 40:07.160
The Tale of the Feathered Immortal

621
40:07.224 --> 40:09.230
without praising its clear and graceful style,

622
40:09.288 --> 40:11.272
appealing to both refined and popular tastes?

623
40:11.800 --> 40:14.320
Even Scholar Shouyi of Qixia Academy said

624
40:14.400 --> 40:17.400
it combines the beauty of southern tunes and northern lyrics

625
40:17.464 --> 40:19.352
while bringing forth something new.

626
40:21.510 --> 40:23.280
Many outsiders are guessing

627
40:23.630 --> 40:25.800
that Shen Rugu, who wrote the play,

628
40:26.110 --> 40:27.320
is actually Mister Lu,

629
40:28.230 --> 40:30.630
and that Mister Lu simply changed his writing style

630
40:31.190 --> 40:32.840
but feared people would gossip,

631
40:33.352 --> 40:35.496
so he deliberately used a different pen name.

632
40:36.710 --> 40:37.510
Tell me.

633
40:38.320 --> 40:39.710
Is it really Mister Lu?

634
40:41.710 --> 40:43.550
I only help my master keep the accounts.

635
40:43.840 --> 40:45.510
As for what my master is thinking,

636
40:45.630 --> 40:47.960
I can't say, I dare not say,

637
40:48.072 --> 40:50.232
and it wouldn't be appropriate to say.

638
40:52.630 --> 40:53.960
I heard Shunqing say

639
40:54.150 --> 40:55.688
you still need to go to the pawnshop.

640
40:55.960 --> 40:57.190
Then I won't keep you.

641
40:58.630 --> 41:00.440
Come back for a play when you have time.

642
41:15.860 --> 41:18.380
(500 taels were raised by pawning.)

643
41:21.432 --> 41:24.150
I was just about to go to the pawnshop to redeem my jewelry

644
41:24.190 --> 41:25.510
when Yuchan told me

645
41:25.840 --> 41:27.590
that you had already redeemed it.

646
41:28.510 --> 41:29.960
I'm sorry to have troubled you.

647
41:30.360 --> 41:31.800
Here are 500 taels of silver.

648
41:32.030 --> 41:33.230
Please accept them.

649
41:37.190 --> 41:38.440
We're husband and wife.

650
41:39.320 --> 41:40.630
There's no need to be so formal.

651
41:44.030 --> 41:45.070
The books say

652
41:45.480 --> 41:47.630
a true gentleman keeps money matters clear.

653
41:51.360 --> 41:52.480
I didn't blame you

654
41:53.030 --> 41:54.360
for giving the money to Lv Ji'er.

655
41:55.280 --> 41:56.360
I'm just curious

656
41:56.710 --> 41:58.550
how you managed to earn so much money

657
41:59.320 --> 42:00.360
in only three months.

658
42:11.360 --> 42:13.800
I thought they'd already told you everything.

659
42:15.070 --> 42:16.760
I only know that this silver

660
42:16.856 --> 42:18.360
came from opera troupes in Jinling,

661
42:18.440 --> 42:20.960
Suzhou, and the capital

662
42:21.150 --> 42:22.800
under Mister Lu's name.

663
42:23.550 --> 42:26.070
But I don't know what you did.

664
42:30.150 --> 42:31.760
I'm Mister Lu's student.

665
42:31.920 --> 42:32.880
What else could I do?

666
42:33.550 --> 42:35.280
Naturally, I wrote plays for performers.

667
42:43.590 --> 42:44.400
I know

668
42:44.590 --> 42:45.880
you surely can't accept

669
42:46.000 --> 42:48.280
the wife of the Lin family writing plays for performers.

670
42:49.760 --> 42:50.840
If word gets out,

671
42:50.840 --> 42:52.360
it won't reflect well on the family.

672
42:52.590 --> 42:55.590
I might even be condemned for corrupting public morals.

673
42:56.710 --> 42:58.360
But this is what I want to do.

674
42:58.920 --> 43:00.550
I decided on it before I married you.

675
43:04.860 --> 43:07.380
=Against the Current= (Next Episode's Preview)

676
43:10.670 --> 43:12.190
(It's my fault for being so helpless.)

677
43:14.590 --> 43:17.280
(From now on, you won't have to live in fear with me anymore.)

678
43:18.260 --> 43:20.100
(Arsenic)

679
43:29.710 --> 43:30.550
What are you doing?

680
43:40.550 --> 43:41.400
What?

681
43:41.700 --> 43:43.420
(Arsenic)

682
44:00.981 --> 44:05.101
♪Spring slips from the branches once more♪

683
44:07.941 --> 44:12.461
♪Flowers bloom unseen, as they have before♪

684
44:13.741 --> 44:17.661
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

685
44:18.341 --> 44:21.101
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

686
44:21.821 --> 44:24.141
♪Though all the world may fade♪

687
44:24.141 --> 44:27.221
♪Time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

688
44:28.741 --> 44:32.981
♪Night winds wander through the halls of long ago♪

689
44:35.901 --> 44:40.061
♪No page could hold the longing words can never show♪

690
44:41.861 --> 44:45.421
♪Every joy and sorrow in this fleeting life♪

691
44:45.421 --> 44:48.981
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

692
44:49.781 --> 44:55.461
♪While whispers of perfume linger beneath the eaves♪

693
44:55.821 --> 45:00.141
♪Let the cold wind rage, let the wild rain fall♪

694
45:00.501 --> 45:03.461
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

695
45:03.461 --> 45:07.221
♪Let love fall to pieces, let old anger burn away♪

696
45:07.221 --> 45:10.101
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

697
45:10.101 --> 45:14.181
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

698
45:14.181 --> 45:17.541
♪And silver moonlight to guide me through the night♪

699
45:17.541 --> 45:21.301
♪Let beginnings fade as endings come to call♪

700
45:21.301 --> 45:25.301
♪From this endless dream, there's no return at all♪

701
